# Runtime state: the database, the vector index and the model cache are all
# generated, so they are not source artifacts. `data/` is ignored wholesale rather
# than by subdirectory - listing the subdirectories individually left files like
# data/server.log untracked-but-committed, which is how a stray log ends up in a
# repository.
